========================================================================================
P3  WHAT DARK MATTER IS, QUANTIFIED + the V3 isolating observables
========================================================================================

    DARK MATTER = the EQUILIBRIUM SECTOR + the FREE DUST.
      equilibrium sector : novel, zero-parameter, baryon-tracking 1:1 inside r_M
                          (M_dark(<r_M) = M_b exactly, G03E; rho ~ r^-2; the dSph
                          floor; the universal surface density a0/(pi G); the funnel).
                          Layered onto ~1% of the cosmic budget -- its abundance is
                          BOUND, not derived, and it cannot close Omega_dm.
      free dust          : the rest (~99%), the Noether charge NOT equilibrated
                          (g >> a0 -- H032's two-state structure).  On cluster scales
                          it sits in M200 halos with f_dark ~ 6-10, collisionless,
                          functionally CDM -- THE THEORY'S HONEST OVERLAP WITH LCDM.
    WHAT IS NEW is the inner-galaxy component and its zero-parameter normalization;
    NOT the cosmic abundance (Omega_dm is matched by standard halo occupancy, i.e.
    the astrophysical normalization as before).
    EXCLUDED on the committed record: the one-constant 'closure' (Omega_Lambda from
    a0: circular -- L258 A1/A2, G03C; not recomputed here); the hot-relic neutrino
    route (f04/f06, structurally dead).

    V3(a) THE INNER PROFILE: within r_M the law's dark density is rho ~ r^-2
          (M_dark(<r) = M_b r/r_M -> d ln M_dark/d ln r = 1); NFW is rho ~ r^-1
          (d ln M/d ln r = 2).  Same enclosed-mass slope: 1 vs 2 -> discriminant
          in resolved rotation/lensing of LSB galaxies inside r_M, and in the
          dSph line-profile shape (the isothermal sheet vs the NFW cusp).
    V3(b) THE dSph FLOOR (G03G, recomputed here): sigma_pred = (G M_* a0)^(1/4)/sqrt2
          Draco     : sigma_obs =   9.1, sigma_pred =   5.5 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = -0.22
          Sculptor  : sigma_obs =   9.2, sigma_pred =   9.2 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = -0.00
          Fornax    : sigma_obs =  11.7, sigma_pred =  15.2 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = +0.11
          Leo I     : sigma_obs =   9.2, sigma_pred =  10.6 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = +0.06
          Carina    : sigma_obs =   6.6, sigma_pred =   5.9 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = -0.05
          Sextans   : sigma_obs =   7.1, sigma_pred =   6.3 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = -0.05
          Crater II : sigma_obs =   2.7, sigma_pred =   3.3 km/s, log10(pred/obs) = +0.08
          median log10(pred/obs) = -0.00 (zero parameters, M_* only)
    V3(c) THE UNIVERSAL SURFACE DENSITY (G078): <Sigma_dark>(<r_M) = a0/(pi G) = 213.75 Msun/pc^2, spread over 1e6..1e13 Msun: 4.4e-16
    V3(d) THE FUNNEL (G076): z_c(R) = a0/(16 pi G rho_b(R)); z_c(8.2) = 140.63 pc (E2's committed 140.63 pc), z_c(15)/z_c(8.2) = 9.65 = e^2.267 (the e+R/3 flare); NFW has NO surface-density coupling
    V3(e) THE EQUIPARTITION VIOLATION: the law gives f_dark = 1 inside r_M; clusters measure f_dark ~ 6-10 (H012: 6.8x at 420 kpc) -- the cleanest cluster-scale isolation of the free dust (g ~ 8 a0 -> no equilibration, H032's regime map).
